{"id":"4018053997227696998","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"Last night I went to a concert solo, and randomly sat next to a guy that was also there solo (this is not a meet cute). We were chatting about where we’re from and what we do, and I found out he’s a train engineer. Coincidentally I am taking a train back down to Oregon. Extra coincidentally, he is driving that train. I’m on it now! He told all the conductors about the chance meeting, and told them my name, and they’ve come by to say hello. I’m an Amtrak Coast Starlight celebrity!","username":"hellcatbetty","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@hellcatbetty/post/DfC_tJpGGNm","timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:43:04Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-10-28T19:47:18.67117902Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-28T19:47:24.782104Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-28T19:47:24.782104Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_b42401de8978e31b","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4018069002232472924","query":"演唱会","source_queries":["演唱会"],"text":"张峻豪为什么不能有消极情绪了好奇怪。我熟知他以来他真的很少有消极情绪外露的时候了，他本来就没有做错任何事情被耽误了一定要故作坚强装松弛吗。？缘计划的资源我记得我刚喜欢上他的时候就有听说粉丝有帮他争取，最后也如愿了。因为珍惜，所以很努力想去做得更好，去的那几期效果不错他自己也喜欢。新的一季他又成长了，还想去把自己最好的一面展示出来，就在演唱会唱了很多缘计划的歌。他一直在向前，有能力做更好的音乐，最后不是自己的原因丢失了机会我想只要不是不上进的人都会遗憾。","username":"in_shuaa","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@in_shuaa/post/DfDDHgJEyVc","timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:12:52Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱会"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-10-28T19:47:10.276682058Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-28T19:47:24.782104Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-28T19:47:24.782104Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_c8b8af0705f6b848","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
